OL,3,AMore than 1.6 million urged to evacuate
OL,4,Aas powerful typhoon threatens Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan is bracing for record rainfall
OL,7,Ffrom a powerful typhoon moving close to
OL,8,FTokyo
OL,10,FMore than 1.6 million people across
OL,11,Ffive prefectures are under evacuation
OL,12,Forders
OL,14,FIn Kanagawa prefecture, a woman is
OL,15,Fbelieved to have been buried alive
OL,16,Fafter a landslide crushed a house
OL,18,FSome 300 flights have been cancelled
OL,19,Fand some train services suspended
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
